cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying publication and this repository."
title: "ALPHA GPU-MOC Transport Reproducibility Package"
type: software
authors:
  - name: CaoWei
    affiliation: "ALPHA Reactor Team, Zhejiang Institute of Modern Physics, School of Physics, Zhejiang University, Hangzhou, China"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-09-17
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A transport-only CUDA implementation and benchmark case from ALPHA,
  the Advanced Lattice Physics code based on Heterogeneous Architecture,
  for reproducing two-dimensional GPU method-of-characteristics transport
  calculations with high-order scattering-source paths 13--16, optional
  FSR clustering, and full-angle or per-azimuth sweeping.
keywords:
  - neutron transport
  - method of characteristics
  - GPU computing
  - CUDA
  - high-order scattering source
  - FSR clustering
  - reactor physics
